    <string name="harness_crops_title">Share your face images?</string>
    <string name="harness_crops_body">Optional and separate: also sends the small aligned face picture from checks where you are the enrolled person, to compare face models on real phones. Never anyone else, never the camera view.</string>
    <string name="harness_crops_confirm">This sends a 112×112 picture of your face, plus a random ID, the light setting and the phone model, to the test team’s private database. A face picture is biometric data. Only the test team can read it, it is used only to evaluate face models, and it is deleted when testing ends. You can turn this off any time here and ask for your pictures to be deleted using your Tester ID.</string>
    <string name="harness_crops_on">Face images: on</string>
